    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keplerian Space Discovery is a realistic spaceship trajectory simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our solar system</strong> is built to scale and rendered with lifelike graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Furthermore</strong>, the motion of each celestial body is precisely simulated using <strong>Kepler's laws</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can construct</strong> their own rocket by assembling various components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Me to the Moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, let's go to the moon, the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's one big step for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rabbits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Policy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be streamed or have videos posted without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or which parts of the game you can showcase.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keplerian Space Discovery is a realistic spaceship trajectory simulator game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our solar system</strong> is built to scale and rendered with lifelike graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Furthermore</strong>, the motion of each celestial body is precisely simulated using <strong>Kepler's laws</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can construct</strong> their own rocket by assembling various components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fly Me to the Moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, let's go to the moon, the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's one big step for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rabbits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Policy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be streamed or have videos posted without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on monetization or which parts of the game you can showcase.</p>",
